            "text": "The Bedford Aerodrome served the Bedford Autodrome and its International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO) identifier is EGBF. The Bedford Aerodrome is at an elevation of 83.2104 above sea level and has a runway, which is made out of concrete, called 08/26."
